/P 72 0 R
/E (Compass View Guesthouse is one of those rare places.  Tucked beneath the endless skies of the Great Karoo, in the timeless village of Nieu-Bethesda, Compass View is more than a beautifully restored guesthouse-it's a place where you are invited to slow down, breathe deeply, and remember how wonderful life feels when nothing is hurried. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
